menu "Havoc Radio"

config HAVOC_FIRMWARE_BRANCH
    string "Branch the firmware update reads"
    default "firmware"
    help
        The branch of hoverboardhavoc/havoc-radio that Settings > Firmware > Update reads its manifest and image
        from, in the folder of the flash layout. Releases publish to `firmware`; a bench test can point a build at a
        branch with a test manifest.

endmenu
